Types of Lambda expressions:
No arguments, one argument, two argument, with explicit arguments, multiple statement

No arguments:          ()->System.out.println("Hello")
One argument:          s->System.out.println(s) 
Two argument:          (x, y)-> x + y
with explicit arguments types  (Integer x, Integer y) -> x + y
multiple statement    (x, y)-> {
                                              System.out.println(x); 
                                              System.out.println(y) ;
                                              return(x + y);
                                     }

